<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#MobileCollectionPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#CollectionPoint> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#MobileCollectionPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mobile Collection Point" .
# 
# https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#PermanentCollectionPoint
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#PermanentCollectionPoint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#PermanentCollectionPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#CollectionPoint> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#PermanentCollectionPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Permanent Collection Point" .
# 
# https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteContainer
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteContainer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Contenedor de residuos"@es .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Es un recipiente usado para almacenamiento temporal de basuras que está normalmente hecho de metal o plástico."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "It is a container used for the temporary storage of waste, typically made of metal or plastic."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Waste Container"@en .
# 
# https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://edint.es/def/infraestructura#Facility> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A facility intended for the collection, treatment, transport, or storage of garbage and other waste."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Equipamiento destinado a la  recogida, tratamiento, transporte o almacenamiento de la basura y otros desechos."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Equipamiento de Residuos"@es .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Waste Facility"@en .
# 
# https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteManagementFacility
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteManagementFacility> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteManagementFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteFacility> .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteManagementFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A designated site or structure equipped to handle, process, treat, store, or dispose of various types of waste. For example, a landfill or a recycling and processing center."@en .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteManagementFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Equipamiento para la gestión de residuos"@es .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteManagementFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un sitio o estructura designada y equipada para gestionar, procesar, tratar, almacenar o eliminar diversos tipos de residuos. Por ejemplo, un vertedero o un centro de reciclaje y procesamiento."@es .
<https://edint.es/def/gestion-residuos#WasteManagementFacility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Waste Management Facility"@en .
